      "translationZh": "使用 Hugging Face Neuron Deep Learning AMI 在 EC2 Neuron 上进行微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c807d50fa2152b98",
      "translationZh": "部署 DeepSeek R1 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "44185f2847aa8c05",
      "translationZh": "使用 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 在 AWS 上部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f25d84f7108a3e0e",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 提供了一种简单且安全的方式，可将机器学习模型部署到专用计算资源上，用于 AWS 上的生产环境。Inference Endpoints 让开发者和数据科学家都能在无需管理基础设施的情况下创建 AI 应用：将部署流程简化为只需点击几下，包括通过自动扩缩容处理大量请求、通过缩容至零降低基础设施成本，以及提供高级安全功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6ec36b7f82f4b4e",
      "translationZh": "借助 Inference Endpoints，你可以部署 DeepSeek-R1 的 6 个蒸馏模型中的任意一个，也可以部署 Unsloth 制作的 DeepSeek R1 量化版本：https://huggingface.co/unsloth/DeepSeek-R1-GGUF。在模型页面上，点击 Deploy，然后点击 HF Inference Endpoints。你将被重定向到 Inference Endpoint 页面，我们已在该页面为你选好了经过优化的推理容器，以及运行该模型的推荐硬件。创建端点后，你就可以通过 AWS 以每小时 8.3$ 的费用向 DeepSeek R1 发送查询了 🤯。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "834260bc60b31d9e",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Inference Endpoints Model Catalog 中找到 DeepSeek R1 及其蒸馏模型，以及其他热门的开放 LLM，它们都已准备好，可在经过优化的配置上部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38604988ba21c925",
      "translationZh": "| 注意：团队正在努力支持在 Inferentia 实例上部署 DeepSeek 模型。敬请期待！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "142c62fc2be153ca",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Bedrock Marketplace 上部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca2939ba8b88cea4",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过市场在 Amazon Bedrock 上部署 Deepseek 蒸馏模型，这会在底层的 Amazon SageMaker AI 中部署一个端点。以下视频展示了如何在 AWS 控制台中进行操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "07f54e08c5da4ad1",
      "translationZh": "使用 Hugging Face LLM DLCs 在 Amazon Sagemaker AI 上部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e7d4f890c7051651",
      "translationZh": "在 GPU 上运行 DeepSeek R1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7238de49c5ae17a0",
      "translationZh": "| 注意：团队正在努力实现使用 Hugging Face LLM DLCs 在 Amazon Sagemaker AI 的 GPU 上部署 DeepSeek-R1。敬请期待！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cf87df7544921147",
      "translationZh": "在 GPU 上运行蒸馏模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7226d9430153225a",
      "translationZh": "你可以直接使用 Jumpstart，或使用 Python Sagemaker SDK，通过 Hugging Face LLM DLCs 在 Amazon Sagemaker AI 上部署 Deepseek 蒸馏模型。以下视频展示了如何在 AWS 控制台中进行操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd9c4436ecf7c5d0",
      "translationZh": "现在我们已经了解了如何使用 Jumpstart 进行部署，接下来让我们逐步了解如何使用 Python Sagemaker SDK 部署 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d84bb91c76bbad39",
      "translationZh": "模型页面上的 Deploy 按钮下方提供了代码片段！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9cb9ecccc0120d9",
      "translationZh": "在此之前，我们先来看几个先决条件。请确保你已配置 Sagemaker Domain，在 Sagemaker 中有足够的配额，并拥有一个 JupyterLab 空间。对于 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B，你应将 ml.g6.48xlarge 用于端点的默认配额提高到 1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "081747d17da718f9",
      "translationZh": "以下是我们建议你为各个蒸馏变体使用的硬件配置，供参考：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "894583b8fb98ecc1",
      "translationZh": "实例类型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71edc6303379ca74",
      "translationZh": "每个副本的 GPU 数量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34965a0898ffcd34",
      "translationZh": "进入笔记本后，请确保安装最新版本的 SageMaker SDK。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "219a7b238a153441",
      "translationZh": "然后，实例化一个 sagemaker_session，用于确定当前区域和执行角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83915e0048d8cacf",
      "translationZh": "使用 Python SDK 创建 SageMaker Model 对象：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fce0460b08da8e67",
      "translationZh": "将模型部署到 SageMaker 端点并测试该端点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba5481846d0fee1c",
      "translationZh": "就这么简单，你已经部署了一个 Llama 70B 推理模型！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b1663493cfd89f2",
      "translationZh": "由于底层使用的是 TGI v3 容器，系统会自动为给定硬件选择性能最佳的参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b6669d78e6ca7da",
      "translationZh": "测试完成后，请务必删除该端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a51dbfb05b053b44",
      "translationZh": "Neuron 上的蒸馏模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2406a9b02c1b2007",
      "translationZh": "接下来，我们逐步介绍如何在 Neuron 实例（例如 AWS Trainium 2 和 AWS Inferentia 2）上部署 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d84bb91c76bbad39",
      "translationZh": "模型页面的 Deploy 按钮下提供了代码片段！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8022c5b1e5a021f3",
      "translationZh": "部署到 Neuron 实例的先决条件相同。请确保已配置 SageMaker Domain、拥有足够的 SageMaker 配额，并具备一个 JupyterLab 空间。对于 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B，你应将用于端点的 ml.inf2.48xlarge 默认配额提高到 1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "219a7b238a153441",
      "translationZh": "然后，实例化一个 sagemaker_session，用于确定当前区域和执行角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83915e0048d8cacf",
      "translationZh": "使用 Python SDK 创建 SageMaker Model 对象：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fce0460b08da8e67",
      "translationZh": "将模型部署到 SageMaker 端点并测试该端点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c72bbc773004f59a",
      "translationZh": "就这样，你已经在 Neuron 实例上部署了一个 Llama 70B 推理模型！在底层，它从 Hugging Face 下载了一个预编译模型，以缩短端点启动时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b6669d78e6ca7da",
      "translationZh": "测试完成后，请务必删除端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e3d97a0537c82b00",
      "translationZh": "使用 Hugging Face Neuron Deep Learning AMI 在 EC2 Neuron 上部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be77b44f3fb586e2",
      "translationZh": "本指南将详细介绍如何在 inf2.48xlarge AWS EC2 实例上导出、部署和运行 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-70B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5c6d7312ee06788",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，我们先来完成几项准备工作。请确保你已在 Marketplace 上订阅 Hugging Face Neuron Deep Learning AMI。它提供了在 Trainium 和 Inferentia 上训练及部署 Hugging Face 模型所需的全部依赖项。然后，使用该 AMI 在 EC2 中启动一个 inf2.48xlarge 实例，并通过 SSH 连接。如果你之前没有操作过，可以查看我们的分步指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7034c649286227cb",
      "translationZh": "连接到实例后，你可以使用以下命令将模型部署到端点上：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "008320e3acc9f9ea",
      "translationZh": "从 Hugging Face 缓存下载已编译的模型并启动 TGI 端点需要几分钟时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a47413f2d4761ec5",
      "translationZh": "然后，你就可以测试该端点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71612bc170dec2a3",
      "translationZh": "测试完成后，请务必暂停 EC2 实例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1f551c0094254e1",
      "translationZh": "| 注意：团队正在努力实现通过 Hugging Face Neuron Deep Learning AMI 在 Trainium & Inferentia 上部署 DeepSeek R1。敬请期待！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1f9d9331370eaa17",
      "translationZh": "微调 DeepSeek R1 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
